{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36776","headline":"暇日投钱尚父 · 罗隐","name":"暇日投钱尚父","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牛斗星边女宿间，栋梁虚敞丽江关。\n望高汉相东西阁，名重淮王大小山。\n礼设鬬倾金凿落，马蹄争撼玉连环。\n自慙麇鹿无能事，未报深恩鬓已斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}